Upstream source was cloned at commit cc98b3a and then adapted:

* The Claude Agent SDK execution layer (base-action/src/run-claude.ts,
  run-claude-sdk.ts, parse-sdk-options.ts, setup-claude-code-settings.ts,
  install-plugins.ts, workload-identity.ts) was replaced with a runner that
  spawns the Pi coding agent CLI (base-action/src/pi/).
* Provider bootstrap, JSONL event parsing, structured-output extraction and the
  step summary report were written for this project.
* Anthropic-specific provider inputs (Bedrock, Vertex, Foundry, workload
  identity federation) and Claude Code plugins were removed.
* GitHub-facing behavior (triggers, modes, branches, pull requests,
  permissions, comments) is retained from upstream.

The original MIT license text is retained in LICENSE.
